# Tenacious Tosk {3}{G} is a 4/4 Tosk Rogue. Cast on turn 1 off four Moxen, it attacks Bot2 on turn 3. "This creature can't
# be blocked by more than one creature" (CR 509.1b; the core keyword CantBeBlockedByMoreThanOne, which the card file grants): Bot2's two
# Ornithopters may not both block it (the refusal), and Bot2 leaves it unblocked. The combat damage to a player triggers
# (CR 603.2, 510.1) and puts a +1/+1 counter on it, so it is a 5/5 at the end.

